Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* Alert.Note on-screen START as golden: note.cpp:3806-3824 BtnStartClick (the only OnClick of BtnStart, note.dfm:335-356) calls
  Start() only for CUSTOMER_CODE==CC_SIGURD_PeiXing or in SIM; on this machine (CC_PTI, shipping) it does nothing.  The web answer
  path restarted the machine on <key>:BtnStart; it now refuses with the reason (tools/wb_serve.cpp, on the key-gate line, before the
  key gate and the D-026 gate; W906_NoteScreenStartActs in forms/fNote_WebKeyGate.cpp).  The PANEL START key (ScanKey :3024 ->
  Start :3527, W906_AlarmIoAnswer) is unchanged and still starts.
* IO window open steps in C++ (JsonBridge/IoFormShow.cpp, new): on the fresh closed->open edge of fiosetview in the window registry,
  golden sbIOClick main.cpp:27946 (SystemStart -> nothing) / :27954 NewRecordProcess MES2190 Enter IO, then FormShow
  iosetview.cpp:306-307 SwFMotorBreaker / SwBMotorBreaker Off (the brake holds) and :309-329 the Index axes' position records.
  Stale / reconnect / minimized->open are not an open.  Main loop only (wb_serve.cpp:4597, after W906_IoTestSuckTick); line-neutral.
  Not done (listed in the file): TTLLog, ProceeToolBar, SetWorkParameter, BackUpOutputData + the close restore, C_TurnTrayArm lock.
* tests: NoteWebKeyGate +4 checks (17); new ctest IoFormShow (13: the real WebWindowRegistry.cpp frames, SystemStart guard, edges,
  stale / reconnect / minimized, source pin).

Verified (o2): wb_serve + tests 0 errors; ctest IoFormShow, NoteWebKeyGate, D026_NoteAuth, WB_DialogMailbox, WebCmdGuard,
MainCloseStop 6/6; PE 83/83; production_audit 0 changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
